Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the stories I was just reading about recently uh has to do with the the airline industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:07.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,There was a time when all of them spent, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:14.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,a lot of their advertising dollars and and marketing campaigns on my plane is safer than everybody else's plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turns out nobody wanted to hear about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:20.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,They wanted the c they wanted the companies to take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,What they wanted to hear was that that the airlines could take them to new places, uh, expand their horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,make the world smaller so that we could learn about each other's culture, create new economies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what they wanted to hear about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,They wanted it to be our responsibility to make it safe, not to make it their burden that they think about safety all day all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think this is the same thing that's hap it happened in the auto industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,It happens to to the power generation industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:54.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,it happened to the airline industry and so I think it's a responsibility for all of our all of the leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:01:03.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,all of us to make sure that we take safety and security and building the technology properly our responsibility and uh working
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:11.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,with regulators and of course every single there are so many regulations and so many laws already intelligence is a digital digital
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:18.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,version of what we do and so you would think digital version of some task that humans do so in In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,humans are have regulations across so many different domains already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:28.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it's the FDA, FDA or Nitsa or whatever it is, there's so many different agencies that already have regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:32.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's a way to formulate AI into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, uh, I think the the balance of of precise regulation, uh, don't regulate hypothetical theoretical harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:44.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Regulate actual and pragmatic harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,um and give this technology which is at the at the early stages of the S-curve innovation an opportunity to advance quickly so that it could be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:59.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so some of the people uh to if you just go back and think about some of the and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,remind yourself of some of the ideas of slowing down technology advancement three years ago when it was just being formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:09.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, the advancement is what made it safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The advancement made it not hallucinate grounded on real truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,um iterate until that the the answer uh is uh uh uh scientifically sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um all of those technologies made were made possible through technology advancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we're we're making it safer but advancing it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let let's turn a little bit to your business for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um your your chips uh GPUs, they're they're different from what other people are hoping to build, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so maybe can you talk to the audience about about your products and and why are GPUs different than so any other letter before the PU if you will?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, today we started out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:03:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,we invented a technology called a GPU and basically a GPU does parallel processing tasks and it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,solves things like fluid dynamics and particle physics and quantum chemistry and one of the computer graphics,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:17.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,image processing, um image reconstruction, uh and of course one of the things that it does incredibly well is artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:27.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um our architecture, our technology is general purpose meaning that uh any we support every single closed models,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,we support every single open model, we support languages, we support large models,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,small models, we support um physical models, biological models and so our architecture is funible in the sense that it runs every AI model,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,runs all data processing and and parallel processing tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result, we're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in every cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're on prem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could be at the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in robotic systems and self-driving cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:56.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, and the com the company's been around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We been working on this for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're in our 14th generation of our architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and so, so Nvidia's basically everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:09.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the advantages of doing that is that these infrastructures are so expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:12.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,One gigawatt is about 50 60 billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, back in the old days, people thought building a fab $25 billion was a giant investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, literally one gigawatt is twice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:29.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're building between now and the end of the decade 100 gigawatts because we want to produce intelligence for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so when you're building investing in infrastructure that's that costly you want to make sure that it is fungeible and it's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:47.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,durable because otherwise if you build something that's too specialized and the world's architecture and algorithm changes and these AI models and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:53.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,technologies are changing so fast if it changes then all a sudden it could obsolete the investment that you've made and so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:05:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the reason why Nvidia's uh growth is accelerating is because people are starting to realize that were the safest architecture to invest in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fungeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:09.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is durable and it continues to improve over time through software and uh it runs everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we run every American model, every international model and every modality of models that you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So people are always interested on where the world is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:26.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,If if you were going to give us sort of your big picture view, where where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,um what should we be thinking about that we don't always talk about you know what you you see everything really all the companies of the world sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:42.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,come and visit with you and sort of tell you where they're going how how would you sort of give us a big picture of a set of ideas
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:52.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we don't usually hear about well there's some things that that we hear and and then I'll I'll I'll juxtapose that um against what I expect and so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,for example in the next couple of years we are going to achieve essentially
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:06:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,what people call AGI and and um and that's not an illogical thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, I would argue that we're practically there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:09.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so the question is what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um it either means a lot or it doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so let me give you an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we said that in the next couple of years we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:26.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,achieve artificial general intelligence um and every and there's no question everybody's everybody's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,tasks the things that we do whether it's in um just learning or working or uh every single industry will be impacted it will benefit everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, the part that is that is not not thought through is in fact uh the thought experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me just give you the thought experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suppose and you know that several several hundred years ago uh humans in order to have a more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,civil society uh manufactured one of the most important things in the world which is called education intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:05.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,We manu through universities and schools we manufacture intelligence and we manufacture stability at scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,is without it, how would we have civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:12.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now we're creating the digital version of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:19.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're manufacturing now intelligence digitally at scale so that even even countries and people who don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,access to the highest levels of education now have the benefits of the highest levels of education.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:25.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that's the simplest way of thinking about what is happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the question is what's the benefit to society as a result of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, let's pretend let's do a thought experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suppose every single uh every single, you know, young person that we hire out of school uh is incredibly well educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that's pretty much consistent with everybody I hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:52.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,They come out of Stanford or Harvard or MIT or, you know, ETH or and these are incredibly smart kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, when these kids come to come to our company and every every company and every industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,we now still have to invest quite a bit in surrounding them with context.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, as it turns out, even when we get to AGI, it's not as if every company's problems are solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:20.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not as if all of a sudden in two years time, I say, "Okay, let me connect it to this a a this AI service."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I just sit sit back and all of a sudden my company becomes more and more productive overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's just not going to happen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to spend all of your energy just like you currently do onboarding a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:39.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,new college grad with a PhD from MIT which is pro surrounding them with context,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,purpose, relevance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,access to, you know, all of these other things which is essentially if you will the harness around these AIs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,the environment around these AIs so that they could do productive work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:09:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that harnessing, all of that environment creation is what companies do, is what leaders do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:05.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as it turns out, our jobs won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our jobs is defined by purpose, context, meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what a job is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that job, there's a lot of typing and talking and, you know, things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those skills are going to be automated by AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tasks are going to be automated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But our our jobs purpose re remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think what's going to happen is that we're all just going to be supercharged just like we're currently supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is we use AI across the whole company today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:40.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,We use off-the-shelf AIs like like anthropics and open AIs and cursor and um and we build
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:45.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,a lot of our own custom AI and I encourage everybody to apply the same the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:52.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should use AI offtheshelf wherever you can but don't forget you have to invest in building your own intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,every country, every company, you can't outsource all of your intelligence to somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you have to use as much of it as you can build as much as you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so uh we do that at the company and and uh and so that's the the first idea is just that we're going to be supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:15.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um the idea that somehow all the jobs are going to be eliminated, removed, that's just nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because of all the things that I've just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the other thing that that is the case is that all of our ambitions are going to be supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as you know we are more ambitious today than any time in human civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:41.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,We think about doing things that are people a 100 years ago would just that's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's got to be science fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:47.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yet we perfectly expla perfectly expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:51.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so just imagine how ambitious we're going to be in 5 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the exciting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:53.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:11:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been working a long time and surely I don't have to work but I don't want to miss I I'm definitely not going to miss the next 10-15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ambition of the industry, the ambition of my colleagues, my own ambition has really been supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is another way of saying that all of all of you all of the countries your ambitions have to be supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the time when you have to feel enlightened, inspired, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,supercharged, lifted because you now have this incredible technology behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you know what do I expect in the next 5 10 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh things that takes 10 years going to take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Things that take one will take a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:39.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, um, you know, if you if you think that that this is going to cost a million dollars to do, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,well, back a long time ago, just, you know, years ago, a million dollars seems like a big investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:48.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,But these days, just think about the level of investments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're talking about trillions of dollars in investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:12:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is now possible for average humans like ourselves to think that we can make an impact on a hundred trillion dollar industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:08.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the first time, you're hearing people, Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:17.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the first time, you're hearing innovators, people, companies, countries talking about elevating a hundred trillion dollar industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,To think that you're going to add 20, 50 trillion dollars of economic benefit around the world, that's ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,No time in history have we been able to say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So my goal for today when we're together is growth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:45.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's our goal that we can all grow and benefit our countries and benefit society.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think what you've done uh Jensen, which we really appreciate, I mean, you are an American treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:13:00.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your company, uh, is leading us in a path that none of us when we were young ever dreamed possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe we dreamed it a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what, you know, sort of sci-fi was about, but now we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think what you've laid out for us is a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:18.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,of that harnessing AI to using it both from uh surrounding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:23.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,contextualizing it and directing it is how we're going to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,That each of the countries here needs to invest in its infrastructure in order to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,capture that for themselves to make sure that their citizens and their society benefits from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They've got to make that infrastructure investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,They've got to build the data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,They've got to harness the AI for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because what you've said is that uh education has been democratized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's made available for everybody.
