Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.98,0:31:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the advancement in the technology has made uh AI hallucinate a lot less be grounded on uh actual truth and be able to solve practical problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.09,0:32:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to keep moving in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.09,0:32:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, every single company has to take it upon themselves to develop the technology safely.
