Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.57,1:16:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heads of delegation, please proceed toward the ministerial room and we'll begin our next session shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.76,1:16:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, press, please remain in the room for a few moments.
