Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.93,1:16:25.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,please proceed towards the ministerial room
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.78,1:16:26.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we'll begin
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.47,1:16:26.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,our
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.64,1:17:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.25,1:18:45.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,session
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.03,1:20:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:21:26.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.87,1:22:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.48,1:22:26.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,break
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.22,1:22:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,down in
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.88,1:22:37.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.71,1:22:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,hallway.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.32,1:23:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.08,1:23:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are we still good or no?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.32,1:23:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.48,1:23:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,She
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.85,1:23:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,said
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.32,1:26:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,they
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.00,1:29:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.68,1:29:17.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.85,1:29:18.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,this working?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.66,1:29:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's still the morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.69,1:29:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're still together.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.05,1:29:23.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.99,1:29:25.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh it's a cool table.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.70,1:29:27.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sort of a little bit of everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.59,1:29:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, good morning everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.41,1:29:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm thrilled uh to officially welcome you to Chapel Hill, North Carolina and for this innovation ministerial.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.92,1:29:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chapel Hill is interesting because it's a critical corner of what we call here the research triangle
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.60,1:29:55.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it's built on one of the great innovation economies in America because it it couples worldclass universities,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.46,1:30:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,advanced manufacturing with technology, skilled workers, and together with public and private investment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.58,1:30:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's it that combination is what we're talking about that everybody
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.52,1:30:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,will do to help their um about their societies and and your citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.64,1:30:22.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 250 years, the United States has been defined by innovation, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.02,1:30:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are inventors.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.77,1:30:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have ambition.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.56,1:30:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,We take risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.98,1:30:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're risktakers.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.57,1:30:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have a relentless drive to build what's next.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.64,1:30:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's our American ingenuity that powers our growth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.04,1:30:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It strengthens our security.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.24,1:30:50.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's expanded human possibility and helped make this nation the greatest economy in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.50,1:30:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And under President Trump,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.93,1:31:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're expanding our ingenuity to address the opportunity of the digital economy that leverages the power of advanced technology and AI,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.44,1:31:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,also nuclear and the coming quantum.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.92,1:31:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,President Trump is trying to deliver the framework that will help America lead
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.00,1:31:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,the world in artificial intelligence and the technologies that define the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.99,1:31:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it's a framework coupled with markets that will help unleash innovation, not regulate it out of existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.64,1:31:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want businesses to invest.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.57,1:31:38.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want developers to discover.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.02,1:31:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want entrepreneurs to feel safe taking risks because that's what entrepreneurs do.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.81,1:31:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want our companies preparing our workforce for the advanced jobs that are coming
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.33,1:32:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and for the new technologies that those that that technology will unleash for our workers.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.44,1:32:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So these are our principles and this is what I want to discuss and make sure we all share in this ministerial.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.00,1:32:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,So over the course of the ministerial we're going to discuss we're going to try to discuss common sense policies that promote innovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.55,1:32:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,They accelerate scientific discovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.08,1:32:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,They strengthen our supply chains and they build confidence across all of our emerging technologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.92,1:32:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The United States proposed statements that reflect these priorities and we've worked extremely well together and
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.77,1:32:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm really proud of the way the group has worked together because these are shared ideals.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.92,1:32:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are not ideals that are ours or and are limited to America.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.01,1:32:50.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are all of our ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.75,1:32:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So our statements they recognize innovation that it depends on an environment where business has
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.05,1:33:02.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,the freedom and confidence to invest to compete and to try to commercialize their ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.78,1:33:07.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It recognized the importance of the private sectorled standards.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.79,1:33:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It recognized increased domestic manufacturing which will strengthen each of our supply chains.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.00,1:33:20.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And importantly, it recognizes that intellectual property rights foster and protect innovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.55,1:33:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that of course includes AI innovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.71,1:33:27.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,But artificial intelligence is going to change how we invent.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.90,1:33:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to change how we create, how companies compete, and how entire industries operate.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.96,1:33:42.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we've got to protect intellectual property and promote AI innovation, but they're not competing goals.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.31,1:33:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can protect intellectual property and promote AI innovation, but that's the tricky part.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.00,1:33:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to find the way to do both things together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.25,1:33:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, they're two sides of the same innovation ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.76,1:34:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,A well functioning intellectual property framework can support innovators and
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.16,1:34:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,creators while preserving the opportunity for AI competition and commercialization.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.80,1:34:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,That balance matters because private investment will drive technological progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.35,1:34:20.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI serves as a powerful tool to enhance human ingenuity but
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.54,1:34:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,also raises new questions about our traditional view of the inventive process.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.57,1:34:29.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.22,1:34:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to change things.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.94,1:34:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is true both for patents and for copyrights for bo both things because copyrights protect authors.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.29,1:34:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,They protect artists and innovators and creators and existing laws provide important foundations but AI technologies are going to continue to develop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.28,1:34:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out and recognize the interaction between copyright and
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.08,1:34:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI and that's going to raise complex questions across all of our jurisdictions.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.79,1:35:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got to establish doctrines and make sure we embrace fair use, fair dealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.12,1:35:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are important tools for balancing the interests of creators and innovators.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.16,1:35:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how those doctrines are going to apply to AI related activities will
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.72,1:35:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,depend on the facts and circumstances that you each address in your own economies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.73,1:35:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But these additionally trade secrets are of course important as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.52,1:35:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Strong trade secret protections are going to foster innovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.48,1:35:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to foster research and development.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.92,1:35:41.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're going to create the competitive markets that are going to help unleash your economies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.14,1:35:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you need to think how you can do both things together.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.76,1:35:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you're going to have to wrestle with both things.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.17,1:35:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to protect intellectual property of others when our own innovators receive comparative protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.40,1:35:59.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to ensure effective remedies when those rights are violated.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.42,1:36:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you have to have the balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.84,1:36:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to protect your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.04,1:36:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you're going to protect your own, you have to protect others coming into your market.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.81,1:36:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has to be both.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.92,1:36:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you don't do both, you'll be left with less opportunity than you would otherwise have.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.76,1:36:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, the challenge before us is not choosing between between protecting innovation and accelerating innovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.71,1:36:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, we all know we must do both.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.11,1:36:28.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we must do both.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.70,1:36:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need frameworks that protect creators and inventors whose ingenuity drives our economies without creating
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.48,1:36:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,the barriers that prevent the next generation of innovators because you heard it here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.48,1:36:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to enhance the next set of innovators because you'll never be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.72,1:36:48.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.91,1:36:49.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.84,1:36:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's figure it out together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.54,1:37:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,By getting that balance right, AI can drive investment, productivity, and scientific discovery in each of our countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.34,1:37:03.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will enhance manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.47,1:37:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will enhance economic growth, and it'll do so across all of our economies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.03,1:37:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the opportunity before us today at this ministerial.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.61,1:37:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I look forward to talking about it together with you all because
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.14,1:37:24.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,this ministerial is about embracing opportunity and growth in each of our economies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.43,1:37:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I thank you all for joining me today.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.33,1:37:29.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm excited for the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.59,1:37:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now I'd like to recognize the delegation from the African Union to lead us on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.32,1:37:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best part is he's doing it on an iPad which shows how the world is going forward.
